{"id":"456971","name":"豆皮鸡蛋汤","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/456971/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"},{"name":"豆皮","amount":"一张"}],"sub":[{"name":"苜蓿","amount":"少许"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"葱末","amount":"少许"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豆皮切好，苜蓿洗净。","img":"images/456971/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋打入碗内，今天碰到一个双黄蛋。","img":"images/456971/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅内放油烧热，放入葱姜炒香，到入适量清水。","img":"images/456971/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入豆皮。","img":"images/456971/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放盐调味。","img":"images/456971/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"豆皮煮熟，放入苜蓿。","img":"images/456971/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"到入鸡蛋液。","img":"images/456971/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"小火慢慢把鸡蛋烫熟。","img":"images/456971/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"鸡蛋液全部飘上来就好了。","img":"images/456971/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/456971/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"清淡美味，喜欢酸辣可以放点辣椒油，陈醋。","img":"images/456971/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}